## 👋 About This Repository

Welcome to my **HTML Learning Journey**! 👩‍💻

This repository documents my progress as I learn **HTML from the absolute basics to advanced concepts**.

Instead of just watching tutorials, I believe in **learning by doing**. Every topic I study will be practiced, coded, and uploaded here.

This repository will grow with me — **one concept, one project, and one commit at a time.** 🌱

> **Starting from zero. Learning every day. Building step by step. 🚀**

---

## 🎯 My Goal

My goal is not just to memorize HTML tags.

I want to understand:

* 🧠 How websites are structured
* 🏗️ How HTML works behind the scenes
* 📄 How to write clean and semantic HTML
* ♿ How to make websites more accessible
* 🔍 How modern web pages are properly structured
* 🧩 How HTML works with CSS and JavaScript

By the end of this journey, I aim to build a **strong foundation in web development**.

---

# 📚 What I'm Learning

### 🟢 Beginner Level

Starting with the absolute fundamentals:

* HTML Introduction
* Basic Document Structure
* HTML Elements
* Tags and Attributes
* Headings
* Paragraphs
* Text Formatting
* Comments
* Links
* Images
* Lists
* Tables
* Forms

---

### 🟡 Intermediate Level

Going deeper into how real websites are structured:

* Semantic HTML
* Forms and Input Types
* Labels and Validation
* Audio and Video
* Iframes
* HTML Entities
* Metadata
* Favicons
* Responsive HTML Basics
* Accessibility Basics

---

### 🔴 Advanced Level

Understanding modern and professional HTML practices:

* Advanced Forms
* Accessibility and ARIA
* SEO-Friendly HTML
* Structured Content
* HTML Best Practices
* Clean Code and Organization
* Performance Basics
* Browser Developer Tools
* Real-World Website Structure

---

# 💻 Learning by Building

I don't want this journey to be only about theory.

As I progress, I'll build small projects and experiments to apply what I learn.

Some things I'll be building include:

✨ Personal Profile Page
📄 Resume Website
📝 Registration Forms
🍔 Restaurant Website Layout
📰 Blog Page
🎵 Media Web Pages
🛒 Simple Product Pages
🌐 Complete Multi-Page Websites

And many more projects as my skills grow.

---

# 🔥 My Learning Rules

For every topic I learn:

```text
📖 Learn the concept
        ↓
🧠 Understand how it works
        ↓
⌨️ Write the code myself
        ↓
🧪 Experiment with it
        ↓
🐛 Make mistakes and debug
        ↓
🚀 Push it to GitHub
```

### The goal is simple:

> **Don't just watch. Don't just copy. Build. Break. Fix. Learn. Repeat.**

